, from healthcare and education to transportation and entertainment. By leveraging the strengths of different modalities, AI systems can provide more accurate, efficient, and effective solutions to complex problems.'}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 1: {'task': {'task': 'summarization', 'id': 1, 'dep': [0], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'response': "The main topic in 'AI systems collaborate across modalities' is the ability of artificial intelligence systems to work together and share information across different forms of data, such as text, images, and speech, to achieve a common goal. This collaboration enables AI systems to leverage the strengths of each modality and create more comprehensive and accurate outputs."}, 'choose model result': {'id': 'ChatGPT', 'reason': 'ChatGPT performs well on some NLP tasks as well.'}}, 2: {'task': {'task': 'text-classification', 'id': 2, 'dep': [1], 'args': {'text': 'AI systems collaborate across modalities'}}, 'inference result': {'error': 'no available models on text-classification task.'}, 'choose model result': ''}}
